WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.560
I have been a cosmetic surgeon
for 18 years now,

2
00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:07.000
and it has truly been a privilege
and an honor

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.080
to be a part of my patients' journey

4
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:13.000
to improve the way they look
and feel about themselves.

5
00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:14.200
Thank you for your trust.

6
00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.400
I really appreciate it.

7
00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.240
I do not want you to worry.

8
00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:22.340
You will have access to me and my team
24/7 after your operation.

9
00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.840
You will have my personal
cell phone number,

10
00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:28.900
and you will be able to get in touch
with us no matter day or night.

11
00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:31.600
How do I know what is
the right procedure for me?

12
00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:35.100
And that, of course, very much
depends on your consultation.

13
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.400
We will see your pictures.

14
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.440
We will meet you,
virtually or in person,

15
00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:41.100
and we will determine that.

16
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.900
If you would like more information,

17
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.700
please tap below,
and we will be here to help you.
